[en.ACHIEVEMENT_PIHC_3RA_C03_MUFFIN_ROULETTE_IDIOT_NAME]
On Purpose

[en.ACHIEVEMENT_PIHC_3RA_C03_MUFFIN_ROULETTE_IDIOT_DESC]
In the §YMuffin Roulette§!, decide to open a box with reverse contract when there is only one good box left.

